{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T21:55:54.830Z","evidence":{"commit":"30f7068075812d7db0221bdff0dbc2380c7b7e53"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f2-api"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"apps/api modules MUST import PrismaClient + model types via @sfx/database (not @prisma/client) — TS resolution fails on direct import. For row types use NonNullable<Awaited<ReturnType<PrismaClient['<model>']['findFirst']>>>.","id":"mx-322b8e"}
{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T21:55:55.009Z","evidence":{"commit":"30f7068075812d7db0221bdff0dbc2380c7b7e53"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f2-api"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"Module test for a NestJS module that depends on AppConfigModule env validation (e.g. JwtAuthGuard wired into the controller) cannot use Test.createTestingModule with the real AppModule — env validation throws at module load. Either stub OAUTH_* env vars or fall back to readFileSync + structural source-string asserts (precedent: apps/api/src/modules/auth/application/controllers/__tests__/auth.controller.test.ts).","id":"mx-4c1538"}
{"type":"failure","classification":"observational","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T21:56:01.527Z","evidence":{"commit":"30f7068075812d7db0221bdff0dbc2380c7b7e53"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f2-api"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"description":"First Prisma model migration in worktree: ran 'pnpm db:migrate -- --name <slug>' which uses 'prisma migrate dev --create-only'. The bridge auto-deploys new migration directories within ~1.5s; manual 'pnpm db:migrate:deploy' reports 'No pending migrations' because the bridge already applied them.","resolution":"Trust the bridge. After db:migrate, just commit the migrations/ directory; no manual deploy step needed.","id":"mx-6d88ea"}
{"type":"pattern","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T22:02:11.647Z","evidence":{"commit":"a27a75c6c7651e04e124ed6237216aee1ccc629f"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-f2-api"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"name":"NestJS integration test with TestAuthGuard override","description":"Override JwtAuthGuard with .overrideGuard(JwtAuthGuard).useValue(buildTestAuthGuard(new Reflector())). Build the guard from a fresh Reflector instance — passing a class via useClass fails under tsx because constructor reflect-metadata is unreliable. Read role from a test header (x-test-role), throw UnauthorizedException on absence and ForbiddenException on role mismatch (mirrors real guard). Required OAUTH_* env vars must be set in a sibling setup file imported BEFORE AppModule (top-level import hoisting).","files":[".claude/hooks/no-close-without-source-probes.js",".claude/hooks/no-merge-without-source-probes.js",".claude/hooks/validate-flow-file.js",".claude/settings.json",".claude/skills/feature-plan/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/flow-failure-response/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/product-plan/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/_shared-management.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/bootstrap-and-curate.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/cross-task-flows.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/failure-modes.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-async.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-bulk.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-business-rule.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-concurrency.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-content-negotiation.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-call-invariant.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-resource-chain.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-tenant.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-