{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-17T18:57:34.630Z","evidence":{"commit":"04341fe9454ee360ce30a3cfdfeea51e157f9cb9"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-bg-chunk-a-v4"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"content":"PATCH/PUT/POST handlers declaring @ApiResponse status 404 must bind @ApiBody schema via zodApiBody helper so probe scanner detects Zod contract — without it ZOD_CONTRACT_UNDETECTED_FOR_STATUS_REACH diagnostic fires (probe sends empty body, hits 400 in pipe, never reaches 404 branch, misleading expected 404 got 400). @Body(Pipe) hint alone is invisible to flows-generator under SWC. Same applies to POST endpoints consumers expect to chain via @ResourceCaptures.","id":"mx-967e12"}
{"type":"pattern","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-17T18:57:36.203Z","evidence":{"commit":"04341fe9454ee360ce30a3cfdfeea51e157f9cb9"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-bg-chunk-a-v4"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"name":"soft-delete-slug-tombstone-with-unconditional-unique","description":"Slug uniqueness @@unique([slug]) at Prisma layer is unconditional (covers deleted rows). To allow POST with same name as deleted brand to succeed (spec soft-delete model), DELETE must tombstone slug to per-row unique value like <slug>-d-<cuid> alongside setting deletedAt. Active-set dedupe loop (WHERE deleted_at IS NULL) then derives fresh natural slug from new POST. Without tombstoning, second POST with same name fails unique constraint despite deleted row being filtered out of active set.","files":[".claude/hooks/no-close-without-source-probes.js",".claude/hooks/no-merge-without-source-probes.js",".claude/hooks/validate-flow-file.js",".claude/settings.json",".claude/skills/feature-plan/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/flow-failure-response/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/product-plan/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/_shared-management.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/bootstrap-and-curate.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/cross-task-flows.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/failure-modes.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-async.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-bulk.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-business-rule.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-concurrency.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-content-negotiation.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-call-invariant.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-resource-chain.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-tenant.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-auth