{"type":"pattern","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-05-17T22:42:12.968Z","evidence":{"commit":"b9116e727683069b9b7dca243553586b036c3956"},"name":"integration-tests-share-one-postgres","description":"Vitest integration suite must serialize files when they share one Postgres + Prisma client: set fileParallelism:false, pool:'forks', poolOptions.forks.singleFork:true in apps/api/test/vitest-integration.config.ts. Otherwise parallel files race on prisma.brand.deleteMany() — beforeEach in file A wipes rows file B just seeded mid-test.","files":["apps/api/test/vitest-integration.config.ts"],"id":"mx-bc7ce0"}
