{"type":"pattern","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-05-18T08:39:53.427Z","evidence":{"commit":"7a52621631051781f48c97758dff388b6592226a"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-bg-chunk-d-v2"}],"name":"x-probe-unique-fields-op-level-required","description":"FANOUT_BODY_LITERAL_COLLISION_RISK fix: declare x-probe-unique-fields BOTH at @ApiBody (requestBody) AND at @ApiExtension (operation) level. The probe internals read the operation-level extension; @ApiBody-only extension is not sufficient even though the build-verifiable-features skill example shows requestBody-level placement. Without op-level, chain POST uses literal body and curated flows asserting same slug collide (acme-holdings vs acme-holdings-2). Apply both for safety until skill docs catch up.","id":"mx-59ee87"}
{"type":"pattern","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-05-18T08:40:05.629Z","evidence":{"commit":"7a52621631051781f48c97758dff388b6592226a"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-bg-chunk-d-v2"}],"name":"opaque-cursor-defers-brand-existence-check","description":"Cursor-pagination Linear/GitHub semantics: when a client presents an opaque cursor, controller treats it as an implicit assertion that the parent resource existed at cursor-mint time. Defer parent-existence (assertBrandActive) ONLY to no-cursor first-page requests; cursor-present requests trust the cursor and return what the index finds (empty if parent or cursor row missing). Resolves probe-generated cursor-invalid pagination flows that send sentinel parent id + bogus cursor expecting 200-empty per x-cursor-invalid-behavior. Implementation: apps/api/src/modules/brand-guidelines/application/controllers/brand-guidelines-versions.controller.ts#listVersions.","id":"mx-c46c44"}
{"type":"convention","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-18T08:40:12.780Z","evidence":{"commit":"7a52621631051781f48c97758dff388b6592226a"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-bg-chunk-d-v2"}],"content":"zodApiBody helper from @sfx/validation now accepts opts.extensions third arg: zodApiBody(schema, ref, { extensions: { 'x-probe-unique-fields': ['name'] } }). Extensions spread onto returned ApiBody payload so x-* surface verbatim in OpenAPI requestBody. Pair with @ApiExtension('x-...') at operation level to satisfy both probe extension scan paths.","id":"mx-765e97"}
{"type":"pattern","classification":"foundational","recorded_at":"2026-05-18T10:50:49.888Z","evidence":{"commit":"d7d00e3ab2310d4648fcde1d5ac2314f15eb3c53"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-bg-chunk-e-v1"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"name":"agent-audit-via-middleware","description":"Auditing rejected requests from JwtAuthGuard requires Express middleware hooking res on finish event NOT a NestJS interceptor. Guards short-circuit BEFORE interceptors so Forbidden thrown by guard skips the interceptor pipeline. Fix in apps/api/src/modules/agent-audit-log/application/middleware/agent-audit.middleware.ts: JwtAuthGuard sets request.user as soon as token verified before role check. AgentAuditMiddleware uses NestMiddleware plus module.configure forRoutes star. The middleware monkey-patches res.json to capture response body for versionId extraction.","files":[".claude/hooks/no-close-without-source-probes.js",".claude/hooks/no-merge-without-source-probes.js",".claude/hooks/validate-flow-file.js",".claude/settings.json",".claude/skills/feature-plan/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/flow-failure-response/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/product-plan/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/SKILL.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/_shared-management.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/bootstrap-and-curate.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/cross-task-flows.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/failure-modes.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-async.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-bulk.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-business-rule.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-concurrency.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-content-negotiation.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-call-invariant.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cross-resource-chain.md",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring/per-cro